    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KEOGH AUCTIONEERS are delighted to offer 7 Fleming’s Court, Tallow Street, Youghal, Co Cork P36F386 for Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nNumber 7 Fleming’s Court is located on Tallow Street - nestled within a pedestrian cul de sac of just 7 properties - in a super convenient location -  within an easy level stroll all Youghal Town Centre’s amenities – supermarkets, shops, restaurants, bars, public transport, the pretty harbour area and Medieval Gardens.\r\n\r\nNumber 7 presents to market as an End of Terrace Two Storied Two Bedroom property situated at the far end of the cul-de-sac - with the added benefit of a sizable adjoining garage, and a small enclosed garden area to the rear.\r\n\r\nNumber 7 itself has tons of charm and character and a bright and airy atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe front door opens onto a small hallway with the stairs to the 1st floor straight ahead and a door to the right opening onto the Lounge area which follows a traditional town cottage style with a room on either side of the fireplace – one is the kitchen and the other room is a bedroom with an Ensuite Shower Room. This bedroom also has a window into the adjoining garage. An exit door at the back of the Lounge accesses the rear garden via steps – and though a small garden it has great potential to turn it into a pretty outdoor area. The 1st floor is currently configured to be a mezzanine bedroom and ensuite bathroom.  The adjoining garage offers scope to renovate to the new owner’s requirements and is a terrific benefit to the property.\r\n\r\nWhile in need of refurbishment this is a property which offers a superb opportunity for the discerning buyer to turn Number 7 into a lovely home - which is in a lovely area and which is just a little bit different.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
